<%- include('../partials/header') %><main id="main-content" class="container-xl order-page"><%- include('nav') %><div class="cart-heading"><h1><%= id?'编辑商品':'新增商品' %></h1><a class="btn btn-outline-brand" href="/admin/products">返回商品列表</a></div><% if(errorMessage){ %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert"><%= errorMessage %></div><% } %>
<form action="<%= id?'/admin/products/'+encodeURIComponent(id):'/admin/products' %>" method="post" class="order-card admin-product-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<%= version %>">
<div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-name">商品名称</label><input class="form-control" id="p-name" name="name" maxlength="120" required value="<%= values.name %>"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-sku">SKU（唯一编号）</label><input class="form-control" id="p-sku" name="sku" maxlength="64" required value="<%= values.sku %>"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-category">分类</label><select class="form-select" id="p-category" name="categoryId" required><option value="">请选择</option><% categories.forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c.id %>" <%= String(c.id)===String(values.categoryId)?'selected':'' %>><%= c.name %><%= c.is_active?'':'（分类已停用）' %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-status">商品状态</label><select class="form-select" id="p-status" name="status"><option value="inactive" <%= values.status==='inactive'?'selected':'' %>>下架</option><option value="active" <%= values.status==='active'?'selected':'' %>>上架</option></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-price">价格（元）</label><input class="form-control" id="p-price" name="price" inputmode="decimal" required value="<%= values.price %>"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-stock">库存</label><input class="form-control" id="p-stock" name="stock" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" step="1" required value="<%= values.stock %>"></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="p-description">商品描述</label><textarea class="form-control" id="p-description" name="description" maxlength="5000" rows="4" required><%= values.description %></textarea></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="p-image">本地图片地址</label><input class="form-control" id="p-image" name="imagePath" required value="<%= values.imagePath %>"><p class="form-text">图片先放入 public/images，再填写 /images/文件名；可使用 /images/lamp.svg、/images/mug.svg。暂不支持上传或外部图片。</p></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-tag">商品标签</label><input class="form-control" id="p-tag" name="tag" maxlength="30" value="<%= values.tag %>"></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="p-color">图片背景</label><select class="form-select" id="p-color" name="color"><% ['sand','sage','stone','peach','paper','clay'].forEach(c=>{ %><option value="<%= c %>" <%= values.color===c?'selected':'' %>><%= c %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="col-12"><label><input type="checkbox" name="isDemo" value="1" <%= values.isDemo?'checked':'' %>> 标记为课程示例商品</label></div></div><p class="cart-summary-note">若其他请求修改了商品或库存，保存会被拒绝并刷新数据，避免覆盖最新库存。上架商品所在分类也需启用，顾客才可查看。</p><button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand mt-4">保存商品</button></form></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
